OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 31 JAN
OL,4,G1000FDeb Grant
OL,5,     GDeb Grant uplifts the weekend
OL,6,     Gspirit with a melting pot of
OL,7,     Gamazing music and grooves.
OL,8,     GCrossing dub, funk, hip hop,
OL,9,     Gsoul, disco, rock, electronica
OL,10,     Gand nu-wave vibes.
OL,11,G1300FJamz Supernova
OL,12,     GJamz celebrates 2000s New York
OL,13,     Ghouse with reflections from
OL,14,     GJKriv, DJ Spinna and Musclecars,
OL,15,     Gwhile Ella Knight and Fish Go
OL,16,     GDeep revisit the story behind the
OL,17,     Gclassic Cure & The Cause.
